ok like I'm giving special treatment to a particular team.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_18","text":"I get it. Because it might look like we're in on it together?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_menu_realkindness","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_19","text":"Something like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_20","text":"Anyway, I'm here to tell you about something that's been bothering me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_21","text":"I don't see the eliminated participants anywhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_22","text":"You haven't seen any of them around?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_23","text":"Nope. I've been wandering around Coin Rush whenever I get bored, but I haven't seen a single one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_24","text":"And more than fifty participants have already been eliminated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_25","text":"Coin Rush is a big place, but it's still strange that I haven't seen a single one of them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_26","text":"Maybe they're just resting in the recovery room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_27","text":"But for this long?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_28","text":"Those suppression rounds that you guys were using don't seem like the standard issue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_29","text":"I thought those participants were dead at first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"guilty_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_30","text":"Yeah... it really seemed that way...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_31","text":"Hmm... that's true. They aren't your typical suppression rounds.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_32","text":"I wanted to see if I could smuggle some out, because I figured I might have a use for them, but no luck.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_33","text":"They're handed out at the start of the round and have to be returned as soon as the round ends.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sugar_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_34","text":"The organizers are keeping a real close eye on them. Each round even has its own serial number.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_35","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_36","text":"These appear to be suppression rounds manufactured directly by the Central Government. The Big Three aren't currently developing any of their own.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_37","text":"The current specifications are already more than sufficient for their intended purpose of subduing targets.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_38","text":"Now that I think about it, it does seem strange. I don't see why they have to go that far and make such a spectacle of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_39","text":"Perhaps it's to evoke the tension of a game of death. That would certainly be entertaining.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"sin_b","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_coinrushshowdown2_01_s_40","text":"I'm no expert, but doesn't Mustang steer clear of dangerous forms of entertainment?","jump":nu